  Scenario Outline: Handle data validation errors during population of f_invntry_bal_dly_hist
    Given the source table "<Source_Table>" contains records with invalid data
    When the SQL transformation logic is executed
    Then the process should fail with error "<Error_Message>"
    And no records should be inserted into f_invntry_bal_dly_hist

    Examples:
      | Source_Table          | Error_Message                                      |
      | sap_master_data       | "g_account cannot be null or empty"                |
      | itemledgerentrieswopd | "g_capture_dt_yyyymmdd must be a valid date"        |
      | reservation_entry     | "g_qty_allocated must be a decimal number"          |
      | item_qty_on_hand      | "g_company_currency_cd must follow ISO 4217 format" |

  Scenario: Ensure uniqueness of g_item_nbr within the system
    Given the source tables contain multiple records with the same g_item_nbr
    When the SQL transformation logic is executed
    Then the f_invntry_bal_dly_hist table should contain only unique g_item_nbr values
    And duplicate records should be discarded or handled as per business rules

  Scenario: Validate join conditions are correctly applied
    Given the source tables have records that meet the join conditions
    When the SQL transformation logic is executed
    Then the records in f_invntry_bal_dly_hist should correctly reflect the joined data based on:
      | Join Condition                                                                                                  |
      | trim(itemledgerentrieswopd.item_no_) = trim(item_qty_on_hand.Item_No_)                                          |
      | trim(itemledgerentrieswopd.location_code) = trim(item_qty_on_hand.location_code)                              |
      | trim(itemledgerentrieswopd.item_no_) = trim(reservation_entry.Item_No_) and trim(itemledgerentrieswopd.location_code) = trim(reservation_entry.location_code) |
      | trim(itmldgentrywopd.item_no_) = trim(rsrv_entry.Item_No_) and trim(itmldgentrywopd.location_code) = trim(rsrv_entry.location_code) |

