  Scenario Outline: Validate date fields format in f_invntry_bal_dly_hist
    Given the source table "<Source_Table>" has date fields
    When the SQL transformation logic is executed
    Then the date fields in f_invntry_bal_dly_hist should follow the "YYYYMMDD" format
      | Field                  | Expected Format |
      | g_capture_dt_yyyymmdd  | YYYYMMDD         |
      | g_dnsa_dt_yyyymmdd     | YYYYMMDD         |
      | g_expiration_dt_yyyymmdd | YYYYMMDD       |
      | g_lot_effective_dt_yyyymmdd | YYYYMMDD   |
    And invalid date formats should trigger validation errors

    Examples:
      | Source_Table          |
      | sap_master_data       |
      | itemledgerentrieswopd |

  Scenario Outline: Ensure currency codes adhere to ISO 4217 standards
    Given the source table "<Source_Table>" provides currency codes
    When the SQL transformation logic is executed
    Then the g_company_currency_cd field in f_invntry_bal_dly_hist should only contain valid ISO 4217 codes
    And invalid currency codes should trigger an error "<Error_Message>"

    Examples:
      | Source_Table          | Error_Message                             |
      | sap_master_data       | "g_company_currency_cd must be a valid ISO 4217 code" |
      | itemledgerentrieswopd | "Invalid currency code in g_company_currency_cd"  |

